        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Baldwin SF-8254, Split Finish Baldwin 8254 Deadbolt</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe Baldwin Squared Deadbolt is a beautiful example of old and new. The Squared Single Cylinder Deadbolt can revamp out-dated decor. This door lock will fit 2-1/8 inch door hole preparations on 1-3/4 inch thick doors and has an adjustable backset for 2-3/8 inches or 2-3/4 inches.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nYou'll find the quality, peace of mind and beauty you expect from Baldwin in every lock. A heavy gauge steel deadbolt case with solid brass working parts gives this ANSI Grade 1, the highest level security, door lock both strength and durability that is backed by a lifetime limited mechanical warranty.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p><b>Single Cylinder Deadbolt:</b> the bolt is thrown and retracted by a key from the exterior or by a thumbturn from the interior.</p>\r\n\r\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/BAL-Single_cylinder.jpg?v=1704354524\" width=\"307\" height=\"141\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Baldwin Single Cylinder Diagram\"></p>\r\n\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Features</b> of the Baldwin 8254 Squared Single Cylinder Door Lock:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Grade 1:  Meets ANSI A156.5 testing.</li>\r\n<li>Material: Heavy gage steel deadbolt case with solid brass working parts.</li>\r\n<li>Brass construction 1\" throw with steel insert.</li>\r\n<li>Cylinders: Solid brass with free turning cylinder guard.</li>\r\n<li>Strike:  Reinforced with 3\" screws.</li>\r\n<li>.600\" x .770\" x 1\" throw when extended.</li>\r\n<li>Hardened Steel insert for maximum security.</li>\r\n<li><b>Limited Lifetime Mechanical Warranty</b></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> of the Square Single Cylinder Deadbolt:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Fits 2-1/8\" diameter door cutouts</li>\r\n<li>Backset: adjustable for 2-3/8 or 2-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Door Thickness: 1-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Length: 2.75\" squared</li>\r\n<li>Rose Projection: low profile 1/2\" cylinder</li>\r\n<li>Steel case: .960\" diameter x 3.312\" or 3.75\" extended</li>\r\n<li>Front: .156\" x 1\" x 2.25\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<i>Special Ordered Item. <b>No Returns</b></i>\r\n</p>",
